    79	How to read the table:
    80	- The D1-parameter wrapper sits between the fast selectors and the certified published methods.
    81	  - On alternatives it gives up about 20-25 J relative to its host.
    82	  - It beats the best certified published method on F0_better by 15.7 (D1) and 18.2 (D2), and
    83	    on F1_late_800 by 12.0 (D1).
    84	  - It cuts null cost by 44-67 J and null switching from 5-12 to 0.02.
    85	- It fails the registered bound on the rho=.8 Markov null: 53/300 and 54/300 (bound .0936). On the
    86	  same 300 seeds the certified published ports promote on 20-25/300, inside the bound, and QSG on
    87	  74/300.
    88	- D5, the gate with A1 evidence, is the only Family D entry inside the bound on F5 (1/300). Its
    89	  power collapses: alt dJ is -6.9, against -34.9 for D2.
