   108	## Mechanism ablations (paired dJ, 20 seeds; full table in ablations.json)
   109	- **Gate front-loading vs pure veto** (D1 - D1-host_only): F0_better -48.1, F9 -49.8. Without
   110	  extra labels the certificate starves.
   111	- **Host-steered vs always front-load** (D1 - D1-always): F1_late_800 -8.6 [-20.0,+2.8],
   112	  F0_null -1.8, F0_worse -2.6. Not front-loading while the host prefers the incumbent saves budget
   113	  for late onset.
   114	- **Host-agreement AND:** inert. Results are identical on every seed in the two-model task.
   115	- **Sharing gate labels with the host:** -4.9 on F0_better (n.s.).
   116	- **Reserve .25:** +15.6 on F0_better. **Rollback:** -6.6 on F3 (n.s.) and +8.4 on F4.
